{"id": "DfR_kb_iphT", "title": "Video by vedastovikings", "description": "He lied to learn a weapon. And the truth came out in blood.\nएक अस्त्र के लिए... उन्होंने झूठ बोला। और सच... खून बनकर निकला।\n\nRefused the Brahmastra by Drona, the charioteer's son told Parashurama, \"I am a Brahmin.\" On the shore he killed a Brahmin's cow by mistake and was cursed: the earth would swallow his wheel, and the warrior he always challenged would cut off his head. Then, with his master asleep on his lap, a worm bored into his thigh, and he did not move. The blood gave him away. Two curses, and on the seventeenth day of the war both came true in the same hour. (Mahabharata, Shanti Parva 12.2-3; Karna Parva 8.90)\n\nThe Brother Who Never Knew, Part 2. Part 3, The Bride and the Dice, is next.\n\nWould you have stayed still? Tell me below 👇\n\n#mahabharat #mahabharata #karna #parashurama #महाभारत", "channel": "vedastovikings", "uploader_id": "60997589521", "uploader": "Vedas to Vikings | Mythology films", "timestamp": 1793712692, "like_count": 4527, "comment_count": 35, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/146.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-17958845712037522a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 62.834, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQP1p9xwkfTv-ypSwl8wO9Ie7s5_Fl9L6nUWv40OzaI2ZSY1kzqEpSR3BIxHTDZ1XD2lkdGDkIx6zoxJEFD8hHvYa_MxGhNtu1DT7lg.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=AdrbiXu7M6I5HgHszlL55u3BXkoB0pzB7o9Ggqx_n8C5cvho8IKCjInyO6JpkT-pFZWU8hMwNj6Tg5EhBX1yhoT5&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=f3wEMlvAMu0Q7kNvwGx-vwm&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=OGHSretqqZaScpivSI7Pt