{"author": "parledu_le", "author_id": "58905312387", "id": "18139984447712129", "text": "@vedastovikings yep drona is partial to arjuna because he promised arjuna. And because drona is a state appointed teacher, his best student should BE THE DIRECT PRINCE OF THE STATE, RIGHT? Thats why he focused on arjuna. Not just that, arjuna proved that he is very capable to become the best.", "timestamp": 1793765267, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "ganesh_singh1996", "author_id": "61273024657", "id": "17880003822562496", "text": "Bhai galat hai thoda pahla right hai dusra wrong🙏🏼 Jai Shree Krishna🕉️", "timestamp": 1793723359, "like_count": 5}, {"author": "abhishek_raj_12", "author_id": "6086914802", "id": "17967070434214205", "text": "wt a worse narration 😂", "timestamp": 1793722433, "like_count": 43}, {"author": "parledu_le", "author_id": "58905312387", "id": "18114744170096963", "text": "The reason is WRONG WHY ARE YOU GUYS SOO PATHETIC. The shloka clearly says:\n\"Karna approached Drona in secret solitude and said: 'I wish to learn the Brahmastra along with the knowledge of its launching and recall protocols.'\"\n\"He asked for it solely with the thought: 'So that I may become equal to Arjuna in battle.' But Drona rejected him and spoke these firm, sharp words:\"\n\n\"No one who is not a true Brahmin observant of sacred vows and Vedic code, nor a Kshatriya who is not endowed with supreme penance and righteousness, is allowed to know or possess the Brahmastra!\"\n\nYES. HE POINTED OUT THAT BRAHMINS OR KSHTRIYAS ONLY DESERVE IT. BUT NOT BECAUSE KARNA IS A SUTA. ITS BECAUSE \"BRO DOESNT HAVE THE MORAL RESTRAINT OF A GOOD BRAHMIN OR A KSHTRIYA\"\n\nDONT PUT FAKE INFO", "timestamp": 1793720811, "like_count": 6}, {"author": "themoney_911", "author_id": "71736621905", "id": "17936139225142384", "text": "Hey yodhha jis rath pe chadkr tum iss brahman aur iss bachde se uche ho jate ho whi rath ek din tumhe tyag dega, jab tum apne jeevan ka sabse mehetvpoorn yudh kar rhe hoge tab bhay ka rakhshas tumhare charo aoor ghoom rha hoga bhoomi tumhare rath ke paiye ko nigal jaygi", "timestamp": 1793720040, "like_count": 3}, {"author": "aikantik07", "author_id": "61182003159", "id": "17895723249654619", "text": "The Most Correct explanation of this part of Jaya Samhita I have ever seen", "timestamp": 1793717403, "like_count": 33}, {"author": "laxmikant_7444", "author_id": "42899825164", "id": "18020134976957976", "text": "Next part", "timestamp": 1793714824, "like_count": 5}, {"author": "prassanttam", "author_id": "3177598965", "id": "17951452392300888", "text": "Waiting for next part Jai shri Krishna", "timestamp": 1793714461, "like_count": 12}, {"author": "vineetyadav_86", "author_id": "45362026360", "id": "17974919685177793", "text": "❤️🙌", "timestamp": 1793713496, "like_count": 4}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DfR_kb_iphT/", "webpage_url_basename": "DfR_kb_iphT", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/886445182_17958846030037522_375779717862274032_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=NDAyMjI3NTUyMzEwNzAwMjQ1MTE3OTU4ODQ2MDI3MDM3NTIy.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=-BgNKftx8rIQ7kNvwE4ZxUs&_nc_oc=AdqMiKeU75BO3PCsqxspzMGaIKXwx30ER3NA4Bm9W_wVczIDB2pLWeqWA3Gen5MwfgiaJauN0iPThkSB1QFr6TuQ&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna&_nc_gid=OGHSretqqZaScpivSI7Ptg&_nc_ss=70689&oh=00_AQQgoLoD5p7q6f_Mvxyz3CgQgsSiW5i8AO-6SNORm_3KDw&oe=6AF84406", "display_id": "DfR_kb_iphT", "fulltitle": "Video by vedastovikings", "upload_date": "20261103", "epoch": 1794270890, "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQMksKyjXT6Wj9IURqh2STnIbxKgM_BzfYW1FrtKBFrrWsoUPRTENs-e9J6OClTLQ6-FxlAriySTu39U3xG0xkbbAA1SHdL4_grsekQ.mp4?_nc_cat=103&_nc_oc=AdruNZC9rX8yd6gTjRbxdkL_be5mMVvDcY_w